sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User Browser
    participant SPA as React SPA
    participant Store as Zustand authStore
    participant API as FastAPI /api/v1
    participant Sec as security.py
    participant DB as Database

    Note over U,DB: Login Flow
    U->>SPA: Enter username + password
    SPA->>API: POST /auth/login {username, password}
    API->>DB: SELECT user WHERE username = ?
    DB-->>API: User record
    API->>Sec: verify_password(plain, hashed)
    Sec-->>API: true/false

    alt Invalid credentials
        API-->>SPA: 401 Unauthorized
        SPA-->>U: Show error toast
    else Valid credentials
        API->>Sec: create_access_token(user.id)
        Sec-->>API: JWT (HS256, 30min TTL, JTI)
        API->>Sec: create_refresh_token(user.id)
        Sec-->>API: Refresh JWT (7-day TTL)
        API-->>SPA: {access_token, refresh_token, user}
        SPA->>Store: login(user, tokens)
        Store->>Store: Persist to localStorage
        SPA-->>U: Redirect to /dashboard
    end

    Note over U,DB: Authenticated Request
    U->>SPA: Navigate to /equipment
    SPA->>Store: getToken()
    Store-->>SPA: access_token
    SPA->>API: GET /forklifts (Authorization: Bearer <token>)
    API->>Sec: decode_token(token)
    Sec-->>API: {sub: user_id, type: access, jti: uuid}
    API->>DB: SELECT revoked_tokens WHERE jti = ?
    DB-->>API: null (not revoked)
    API->>DB: SELECT user WHERE id = user_id
    DB-->>API: User with role_id
    API->>API: require_permission(FORKLIFT_READ)
    API->>DB: SELECT role WHERE id = role_id
    DB-->>API: Role {name: "manager"}
    API->>API: Check FORKLIFT_READ in ROLE_PERMISSIONS["manager"]
    API-->>SPA: 200 {items: [...], total: N}
    SPA-->>U: Render equipment list

    Note over U,DB: Token Refresh
    SPA->>SPA: Axios interceptor detects 401
    SPA->>API: POST /auth/refresh {refresh_token}
    API->>Sec: decode_token(refresh_token)
    Sec-->>API: {sub: user_id, type: refresh}
    API->>Sec: create_access_token(user_id)
    API-->>SPA: {access_token: new_token}
    SPA->>Store: updateToken(new_token)
    SPA->>API: Retry original request with new token

    Note over U,DB: Logout
    U->>SPA: Click logout
    SPA->>API: POST /auth/logout (Bearer <token>)
    API->>Sec: decode_token(token)
    API->>DB: INSERT revoked_tokens (jti)
    API-->>SPA: 200 OK
    SPA->>Store: logout()
    Store->>Store: Clear localStorage
    SPA-->>U: Redirect to /login
